         can work around — per Salesforce, standard-object-adjacent access
         like this must come from the subscriber's Profile, not a packaged
         PermissionSet. Required as a documented post-install manual step.
         (The comment this replaces described an EARLIER, narrower
         understanding — that only the parent-read grant needed to be
